---
interface Props {
  show: boolean;
}

const { show } = Astro.props;
---

{show && (
  <aside class="text-sm text-[var(--color-stone-600)] space-y-2" aria-label="Mr Coconut nutrition sources">
    <p>Calories use Mr Coconut's published standard recipes, checked on 27 November 2026. Cup totals are calculated for 480ml medium drinks and 700ml large drinks, using the brand's separate large-cup figures where available. Per-100ml values refer to the medium recipe; fresh juice values exclude coconut flesh.</p>
    <p>Fresh milk tea and Hojicha calories are not listed because the brand's figures need clarification. Cup totals are also unavailable for hot drinks and recipes without published energy values.</p>
    <p>
      <a href="https://mrcoconut.sg/menu/" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mr Coconut's current menu</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
      <a href="https://drive.google.com/file/d/1EvkCOmlwp-J7bVDlMTpZd_cc2K21Kl-U/view" class="underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official nutrition sheet</a>
    </p>
  </aside>
)}
